     A**
     A** WORKERS' COMP CLAIM HISTORY MASTER FILE
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  SPECIAL FILE NOTES:                                          *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  THE FOLLOWING FILES/PROGRAMS MUST BE MODIFIED ANYTIME A NEW  *
     H*  FIELD IS ADDED TO WMCHP:                                     *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES IN THE      *
     H*    MONTHEND LIBRARY                                           *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES IN THE      *
     H*    TEST ENVIRONMENT.                                          *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - CLIENT 03: NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES  *
     H*    IN WPEACOCK                                                *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - DAILY BATCH PROGRAM MAY REFER WMCHP IN BASE (WFIL)         *
     H*    SPECIFICALLY IN ANY CPYF FOR MONTHEND,  IF A CLIENT        *
     H*    VERSION IS BEING CREATED CPYF MUST BE CHANGED              *
     H*    ACCORDINGLY                                                *
     H*                                                               *
     H*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PCH01                     TEXT('CLAIM HISTORY MASTER FILE')
     A            CHCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            CHFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            CHFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            CHCASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            CHEFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EFFECTIVE' 'DATE')
     A            CHOCST    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('OPEN/' 'CLOSE' 'STATUS')
     A            CHEXPL    R               REFFLD(NM60)
     A                                      COLHDG('EXPLANATION')
     A            CHSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            CHUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            CHPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            CHTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            CHDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
